=== SPEC ===
     1	# Redblue Specification
     2	
     3	**Version**: 1.0-draft  
     4	**Status**: Design Phase  
     5	**Last Updated**: March 2026
     6	
     7	---
     8	
     9	## Table of Contents
    10	
    11	1. [Introduction](#introduction)
    12	2. [Lexical Structure](#lexical-structure)
    13	3. [Types](#types)
    14	4. [Variables and Values](#variables-and-values)
