   651	
   652	## Error Handling
   653	
   654	### Try-Catch
   655	
   656	```redblue
   657	try
   658	    set data to might fail files.read("config.rb")
   659	    process data
   660	catch error
   661	    say "Error: {error message}"
   662	end
   663	```
   664	
   665	### Multiple Catch Blocks
   666	
   667	```redblue
   668	try
   669	    set result to might fail risky_operation()
   670	catch error of FileError
   671	    handle_file_error(error)
   672	catch error of NetworkError
   673	    handle_network_error(error)
   674	catch error
   675	    handle_generic_error(error)
   676	end
   677	```
   678	
   679	### Finally
   680	
   681	```redblue
   682	try
   683	    set file to might fail files.open("data.rb")
   684	    process file
   685	finally
   686	    if file is not nothing
   687	        might fail files.close(file)
   688	    end
   689	end
   690	```
   691	
   692	### Raising Errors
   693	
   694	```redblue
   695	to might fail divide(a, b)
   696	    if b is equal to 0
   697	        give back error "Cannot divide by zero"
   698	    end
   699	    give back a / b
   700	end
   701	```
