   705	## Asynchronous Programming
   706	
   707	### Async Functions
   708	
   709	```redblue
   710	async to fetch_data(url)
   711	    set response to wait network.get(url)
   712	    give back formats.parse_json(response)
   713	end
   714	```
   715	
   716	### Await
   717	
   718	```redblue
   719	async to main()
   720	    set users to wait fetch_users()
   721	    for each user in users
   722	        say user.name
   723	    end
   724	end
   725	```
   726	
   727	### Parallel Execution
   728	
   729	```redblue
   730	async to load_all()
   731	    parallel
   732	        set users to wait fetch_users()
   733	        set posts to wait fetch_posts()
   734	        set comments to wait fetch_comments()
   735	    until done
   736	    
   737	    give back combine(users, posts, comments)
   738	end
   739	```
