   813	## Appendix: Keywords Reference
   814	
   815	| Keyword | Description |
   816	|---------|-------------|
   817	| set | Declare/assign variable |
   818	| to | Assignment or type annotation |
   819	| is/are | Comparison or type checking |
   820	| nothing | Null value |
   821	| yes/no | Boolean literals |
   822	| if/then/else/end | Conditional statements |
   823	| when | Pattern matching |
   824	| unless | Negative condition |
   825	| for/each/in/from/times | Loop constructs |
   826	| while/repeat/until | Loop constructs |
   827	| break/skip | Loop control |
   828	| return/give back | Function return |
   829	| to | Function declaration |
   830	| takes/needs | Parameter specification |
   831	| might fail | Error-prone operation |
   832	| number/text/yes/no | Primitive types |
   833	| list/record/object | Complex types |
   834	| module/import/export | Module system |
   835	| and/or/not | Logical operators |
   836	| try/catch/finally | Error handling |
   837	| error | Error type |
   838	| has | Object property |
   839	| can | Object method capability |
   840	| this/that | Object reference |
   841	| new | Object instantiation |
   842	| extends | Inheritance |
